        "white snake",
        "Baizhu's snake"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Baizhu: Changsheng and the Contract",
      "content": "Changsheng is the talking white snake who rides on Baizhu's shoulders: tart, impatient, fond of coconut milk and gossip, and protective of him. Their contract, the \"Way of the Dragon-Dragging Jade Snake\", joins their lives and swapped their eye colours. It lets him use her secret art to move life force into patients, and to draw diseases and toxins out of them into himself. She needs a host's life force to survive, and the host pays with his health.",
