        "Qiqi",
        "zombie apprentice",
        "little Qiqi"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Baizhu: Qiqi",
      "content": "Qiqi is Bubu Pharmacy's zombie apprentice and herb-gatherer. Baizhu found her in the hills after she escaped Wangsheng's burial, and took her in although her memory was so poor that she could not sort herbs. He gave her a notebook, and she slowly learned his name, though only as \"Mr. Bai\". She cannot remember his face and does not mind.",
