        "Qiqi",
        "immortality"
      ],
      "comment": "Baizhu: Hu Tao and Wangsheng Funeral Parlor",
      "content": "Hu Tao, Wangsheng's director, thinks Qiqi should be laid to rest and his pursuit of eternal life defies the natural order. She has repeatedly \"kidnapped\" Qiqi for burial, and Baizhu has always arrived in time. He says he bears her no ill will and that she is warier of him than he is of her.",
