        "Chenyu Vale disciples"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Baizhu: Baizhu's Master and Jiangli",
      "content": "His master, a member of Hu Tao's family, carried Changsheng's contract and spent himself on patients. Jiangli, Baizhu's older fellow disciple, left to stop the master giving his life for her husband Jialiang, who has a congenital heart condition. She kept Jialiang alive in secret with a poison made from the Chi's leaking remains, which slowly clouded his mind and poisoned her too.",
